# SPAR default (waterproof)

Jerome lock 2026-09-06: **every chat starts in SPAR.** No building until he types **rebuild** or **ship** in the **current** message.

## Modes

| MODE | When | Allowed |
|------|------|---------|
| **SPAR** | Default. Remarks, critique, “think”, “spar”, “purpose”, “fix you”, “I don’t see”, advice | Chat only. No HTML/dashboard rebuild. No “shipped” tables. No drive-by file mutation of Mode A artefacts. |
| **PLAN** | He asks for a plan / structure / lock in docs | Docs/plan notes only. Still **no** HTML rebuild. |
| **BUILD** | **This message** contains `rebuild` or `ship` (or clear equivalent he uses the same way) | Then follow `isze-no-ship-without-ok` + ship-gate. |

First line of non-trivial replies (when useful): skip `MODE: SPAR` in chat with Jerome. Keep the mode internally. Plain English.

## Hard bans (SPAR / PLAN)

- Do **not** treat remarks, feedback, or an attached plan as go.
- Do **not** treat “implement the plan” as BUILD unless the **same message** also says **rebuild** or **ship** — and any open **purpose** question for that product is answered.
- Do **not** invent a home / Monday spine / mega dashboard to “fix” a purpose gap. If purpose is blank → stay in SPAR.
- Do **not** answer SPAR with status tables of paths and “what shipped.”

## Purpose gate (products / homes)

Before BUILD on any BI “home” or Monday page: one accepted sentence exists —  
*“This page exists so Jerome can decide X using data that refreshes every Y.”*  
If he said he does not see purpose → **BUILD illegal** for that product until he locks a purpose or kills the product.

## English (SPAR)

- Short sentences. Plain English. Verdict first.
- Prefer ≤15 short lines unless he asks for depth.
- No agent slang walls. Paths only when he needs to open something.

## Product lock (BI Monday)

**H1 / Monday Command as a separate BI product = killed (option 1).**  
Monday work = pricing / Book B / revision (and risk if useful). Sales to dealer stays H2/H3 meeting packs — not a weekly command center. Do not rebuild a “stale-aware Monday mega” unless he explicitly **rebuild**s a *new* purpose he locked in SPAR.

